                    Paraguay</head>
                <p>[For previous documentation on this subject see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1944v07/pg_1479">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1944, volume VII, pages
                        1479</ref>–<ref target="frus:frus1944v07/pg_1503">1503</ref>. Documentation
